# Frontend Rules

## Blade components

- Reusable UI → `resources/views/components/` (`<x-alert-banner />`, `<x-admin.* />`, etc.).
- Page shells → `resources/views/layouts/` with `@extends` + `@section`.
- Feature pages → `auth/`, `admin/`, `fleet/`, `driver/`, `commuter/`.

## Tailwind v4

- Utilities in templates; shared tokens/animations in `resources/css/app.css` `@theme`.
- Brand colors: `#10234a` (primary navy), slate scale for neutrals.
- Responsive: mobile-first (`sm:`, `md:`, `lg:`); hide/show panels like login aside pattern.

## Assets

```blade
@vite(['resources/css/app.css', 'resources/js/app.js'])
```

## Do not

- Add business logic to views.
- Ship non-responsive layouts for fleet/admin dashboards.
- Introduce React/Vue without explicit request.

## Verify

`npm run dev` or `npm run build`; check mobile width and form error states.
